(UNIVERSITY ACADEMIC REGULATIONS & POLICIES) '
(Official Handbook 2025) '
(Academic Year: 2024-2025) '
(Effective Date: August 1, 2024) '
() '
(SECTION 3: ATTENDANCE RULES) '
(Minimum attendance requirement: 75%.) '
(Students who fail to maintain 75% attendance in any course will be debarred from the end-semester examinations.) '
() '
(SECTION 4: PROMOTION AND BACKLOG POLICY) '
(Students may have up to 4 backlogs for promotion to the next academic year.) '
(A student having more than 4 backlogs shall repeat the entire academic semester.) '
() '
(SECTION 5: GRADING SYSTEM) '
(The minimum passing grade for any course is Grade D \(40 marks\).) '
ET
